n the  Xbox one with the hauppage digital TV  tuner watch free over-the-air broadcast  TV on your Xbox one using this digital  TV tuner it connects to your Xbox one  via USB plug in the included ten-mile  antenna into the TV tuner run through  the Xbox TV configuration and start  watching HDTV get one for $59.99 if they  filled up their Xbox one with games and  need more storage supply them with a  Seagate game drive why delete games when  you can store more this two-terabyte  game drive lets you store up to 50 Xbox  one games the Seagate game drive is  compact and portable and perfect for  bringing over to a friend's house get  your own 2 terabyte game drive for 99  dollars you can use your Xbox one  controller on your PC with the Xbox  wireless adapter for Windows Xbox play  anywhere launched this year allowing  players to buy a game and play it on  both Xbox one and a Windows 10 PC at no  additional cost use an Xbox one wireless  controller on Windows PCs laptops and  tablets using this wireless adapter the  adapter supports up to 8 wireless  controllers and cost $24.99 and last but  not least don't forget a headset  turtlebeach makes great ones like the  xo7 pro the xo7 pro is good for both  casual and competitive gamers alike  it has crystal-clear audio and is quite  durable it features memory foam ear  cushions for comfort and noise isolation  it also has what it calls super human  hearing mode to pinpoint quiet audio  cues like someone reloading or  approaching you get an EXO 7 pro for 150  995 happy gifting i'm chastity and i'll  see you next time  [Music]

